<title>POLAND: Polish NBP sets zloty central parity rates.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP sets zloty central parity rates.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland on Thursday set the central parity rate for the zloty at 2.8823 to the dollar and at 1.8743 to the mark, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Due to technical problems the central bank could not immediately announce the parity rates on its NBPR page.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
